A line that misses the host ends it when a comment closer lies ahead

```
. a
  . %%%
    n
>>
%%%
.
<ol>
  <li>a
    <ol>
      <li></li>
    </ol>
  </li>
</ol>
<p>&gt;&gt;</p>
```

